        "text": "Have you ever seen 1,300 cakes in one place? Well, now you have. Welcome to the San Francisco Cake Picnic where the only rule is no cake, no entry. Each attendee brought their own masterpiece. Just look at this creativity. When you sign up, you get a wristband and a cake box to fill up. Then it's go time. We have six minutes to grab as many slices as we can. My friend Rachel and I went all out and just look at this haul. After the race, we feasted. Cheers to cake and community. And until next time, thanks for coming along.",
